msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/compilation-methods-for-hamiltonian-simulation-circuits/extracted-outputs/c7d8e9f0-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/compilation-methods-for-hamiltonian-simulation-circuits/extracted-outputs/c7d8e9f0-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
